      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PURE GRUNT (3) was an impressive winner when resuming last week, leading from this barrier before getting home by 1.5 metres at this circuit and distance. Fitter and is ideally drawn so can win again. TIMMYTEO (8) showed improvement when runner-up to PURE GRUNT last week. Draws on the back row but should enjoy a nice trail and will be nearing his peak now. Hard to knock the consistency of BENNYDASOOK (2) who has put a series of top-four results together. Will need to lift to turn the tables on PURE GRUNT through the last clash but a good draw can see him competitive again. KIKI MEISTER (5) is consistent and and owns a good record at this circuit and distance. Worth including retuning to the front row.",
